{"at":"2026-11-17T06:26:48.277Z","kind":"verdict","pass":true,"reason":"end state matches","stop":"answered","answer":"PO-000001 has been received in full into the Calgary warehouse (CAL-WH) on goods receipt **RCV-000001**, which is now posted. The check after posting confirmed it.\n\n- **What was received:** line 1, Field notebook (OFF-100), 8 EA. That is the full ordered quantity of 8. The unit cost is 4 CAD, taken from the PO price. Nothing had been received on this PO before.\n- **The first try didn't post.** I dated the receipt 2026-11-17 12:00 UTC, and the system refused because receipts can't be dated after the current business day. The draft receipt and its line had already been created.\n- **How I fixed it:** I changed the receipt date to the PO's order time, 2026-11-17 06:25:55 UTC, and posted again. The post went through.\n- **One thing to check:** the receipt is dated at the PO's order time, not the actual arrival time. If you need the real arrival date on record, tell me and I'll look into whether it can be changed."}
